00:11:06.399 --> 00:11:11.220
I have seen a really cool theory on the Red
Lotus as a possible alternative antagonist

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:16.860
as it relates to the Pai Sho game. I don't
have a lot of information about that, so if

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:19.959
something develops I'll include it in a future
video.

